<title>TURKEY: Turkey says Iran gas deal to begin a year earlier.</title>
<headline>Turkey says Iran gas deal to begin a year earlier.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A $23-billion natural gas agreement between Turkey and Iran will take effect from either end-1997 or early 1998 instead of the original agreement which envisaged it would begin from 1999, an energy official said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
